{"parentUuid":"cfcda7a4-f351-4420-ad5c-10dadfbc8d0f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7a6b2a5e-b755-41c3-a397-cc1321eabe85","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RQTFtjKUrKQVGUx1X3ARoY","type":"tool_result","content":"title:\tfeat: stream-driven progress for explain --generate\nstate:\tDRAFT\nauthor:\tpeyton-alt\nlabels:\t\nassignees:\t\nreviewers:\tCopilot (AI) (Commented), cursor (Commented)\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nnumber:\t964\nurl:\thttps://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/964\nadditions:\t1073\ndeletions:\t109\nauto-merge:\tdisabled\n--\n## Summary\n\nSwitches `entire explain --generate` from silent wait + wall-clock timeout to real-time stream-driven progress and a TTY-gated deadline strategy.\n\n**Previously stacked on #963** (typed error classification). Rebased off main — now fully independent. See _Scope note_ below.\n\n### What users see now\n\n**Interactive (TTY):**\n```\nGenerating checkpoint summary... (transcript: 47.0 KB)\n→ Sending request to Anthropic…\n→ Anthropic responded (TTFT 1.9s, 35.9k cached input tokens) — generating…\n→ Writing summary… (~1.2k tokens)\n✓ Summary generated (3.1s, 1.9k output tokens)\n✓ Summary generated and saved\n```\n\n**Non-TTY (CI):** same lines, one per event (no in-place `\\r` updates). 5-minute idle-based safety deadline + 30-minute hard wall-clock cap.\n\n**ACCESSIBLE=1:** one line per event, no ANSI escape sequences.\n\n### Architecture\n\n- **Stream-json mode**: `claude --print --output-format stream-json --verbose` consumed incrementally by an NDJSON parser (`streamClaudeResponse`). Falls back internally to `--output-format json` if the CLI rejects streaming flags.\n- **`agent.StreamingTextGenerator`** optional capability interface with `AsStreamingTextGenerator` helper. Claude Code implements it via `GenerateTextStreaming` in a new `generate_streaming.go` file — existing `GenerateText` path untouched.\n- **`summaryProgressWriter`** renders `GenerationProgress` phases using exi