{"parentUuid":"3d530208-6f95-4150-bc91-f507a34cfef9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_0135crb3XvqSRbAix2iwa3Qx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- The classifier closes the diagnostic-parity gap between streaming and non-streaming providers cleanly: streaming gets `phase` attribution from observed events, non-streaming gets `kind` attribution from stderr patterns. Both are advisory — both still surface raw signal underneath — so misclassification is recoverable.\n- Pattern-based classifiers degrade gracefully as CLIs change their output: missing patterns just fall through to `Unknown` and the user sees raw stderr. No false-positive classification = no regression from today.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\n**Plan now has 8 chunks, all approved.** Final state:\n\n- **Spec:** `/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-13-explain-summary-streaming-design.md` — round-1 approved, classifier section added for chunk 8 alignment.\n- **Plan:** `/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-13-explain-summary-streaming.md` — 8 chunks, all approved (rounds 1–4 for chunks 1–7, chunk-8 review just clean-approved).\n\n**What chunk 8 adds for non-streaming providers** (Codex, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini):\n\n| Captured stderr pattern | Surfaces as |\n|---|---|\n| `connection refused` / `could not resolve` / etc. | `kind: network` + \"couldn't reach provider API — check network/VPN\" |\n| `401` / `unauthorized` / `not logged in` | `kind: auth` + \"provider rejected credentials — re-authenticate\" |\n| `429` / `rate limit` / `quota exceeded` | `kind: rate_limit` + \"wait and retry\" |\n| `503` / `bad gateway` / `internal server error` | `kind: server_error` + \"API degraded — try again shortly\" |\n| `model not found` / `invalid model` | `kind: model_not_found` + \"check --model flag or settings\" |\n| (no match) | Raw stderr only, no extra label |\n\nApplied in both the timeout diagnostic AND the non-timeout catch-all branch — so users get classification whether the failure was a hang or a fast-fail. Raw stderr is always shown alongside.\n\nSquash grouping for the final PR stays at 2–4 commits (chunks 6+7+8 fold into one \"UX\" commit)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":111,"cache_read_input_tokens":319965,"output_tokens":850,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":111,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":850,"cache_read_input_tokens":319965,"cache_creation_input_tokens":111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":111},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cb2jMtu7SqiYWfq9YeZR1","type":"assistant","uuid":"2b20ab24-b8a7-483e-b293-0108f4e97161","timestamp":"2026-05-14T15:53:52.423Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/redact-2","sessionId":"4944fa51-d7dd-4310-b62f-7802a196cd45","version":"2.1.140","gitBranch":"redact-2"}
