{"parentUuid":"8ec1fd7f-0421-4e2e-bee3-29cc33e7d525","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01XEtrUwh11WxLwav1vAvxa2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Chunk 6/8 ✅** — commit `02fcef04d`. 2 files (+284 -11). Approved. **First chunk with user-visible UX:** TTY users now see live progress phases for `entire explain --generate`.\n\nReviewer Important note carried to chunk 7: TTY error path needs `Flush()` on `summaryProgressWriter` before `formatCheckpointSummaryError` runs — otherwise an error appearing mid-Generating would land on the same terminal line. Since chunk 7 reworks `formatCheckpointSummaryError` anyway, that's the natural place to add the flush.\n\nDispatching chunk 7 (observable-state timeout diagnostic). This is the big diagnostic payoff: rewrites the timeout error path to use captured stream-state instead of the 3-cause shrug message. Also introduces `summarize.TextGenerationFailure` and stderr capture for non-streaming providers."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":610,"cache_read_input_tokens":514258,"output_tokens":477,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":610,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":477,"cache_read_input_tokens":514258,"cache_creation_input_tokens":610,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":610},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cb37VLdBjsfv2qYtcmHey","attributionSkill":"superpowers:subagent-driven-development","attributionPlugin":"superpowers","type":"assistant","uuid":"9cdebcca-80b0-4b84-a794-e3e1464c562d","timestamp":"2026-05-14T20:43:59.700Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio