..}` — chunked\n  - Terminal event TBD: likely `assistant.turn_end` or `assistant.message_complete`. **Capture the actual name and confirm whether it carries usage.**\n\n- [ ] **Step 3:** If the captured stream lacks a clear terminal event, the parser falls back to EOF-as-Done (same as Gemini), computing duration locally and setting OutputTokens=0.\n\n### Task 5.3: Define Copilot stream-event types\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/stream_response.go`\n\n```go\npackage copilotcli\n\nimport \"time\"\n\ntype copilotStreamEvent struct {\n\tType      string             `json:\"type\"`\n\tTimestamp time.Time          `json:\"timestamp,omitempty\"`\n\tData      *copilotStreamData `json:\"data,omitempty\"`\n\tID        string             `json:\"id,omitempty\"`\n\tParentID  string             `json:\"parentId,omitempty\"`\n\tEphemeral bool               `json:\"ephemeral,omitempty\"`\n}\n\ntype copilotStreamData struct {\n\tMessageID    string `json:\"messageId,omitempty\"`\n\tTurnID       string `json:\"turnId,omitempty\"`\n\tDeltaContent string `json:\"deltaContent,omitempty\"`\n\tModel        string `json:\"model,omitempty\"`\n\t// Additional fields based on actual captured terminal event:\n\t// Usage *copilotUsage `json:\"usage,omitempty\"`  // if Copilot emits usage\n}\n```\n\n(Update fields after Task 5.2 captures the real shape.)\n\n### Task 5.4: Write parser tests with synthetic fixtures\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/testdata/stream_success.jsonl`\n- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/testdata/stream_error.jsonl`\n- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/generate_streaming_test.go`\n\nTest assertions:\n- `PhaseConnecting` count = 1 (from `assistant.turn_start`)\n- `PhaseFirstToken` count = 1 (from first `assistant.message_delta`)\n- `PhaseGenerating` count ≥ 1 (subsequent deltas)\n- `PhaseDone` count = 1 (either from terminal event OR EOF fallback)\n- Result text is the concatenation of all `data.deltaContent` values.\n\n### Task 5.5: Implement Copilot parser\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/generate_streaming.go`\n\nDispatch table:\n- `assistant.turn_start` → `PhaseConnecting`\n- First `assistant.message_delta` → `PhaseFirstToken` (no TTFT field — confirm during Task 5.2)\n- Subsequent `assistant.message_delta` → `PhaseGenerating` (append `deltaContent` to a strings.Builder)\n- Terminal event (whatever it's called per Task 5.2) → `PhaseDone` with usage if available\n- **If stream ends without terminal event** → `PhaseDone` with locally-computed duration, OutputTokens=0 (mirrors Gemini's EOF behavior)\n\nSkip all `session.*` and `user.*` events silently.\n\n**Fallback path:** standard — wrap in `StreamingGeneratorTemplate`; on `ErrUnrecognizedStreamingFlag`, call `c.GenerateText`.\n\n### Task 5.6: Test `CopilotCLIAgent.GenerateTextStreaming`\n\n**Files:**\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/generate_streaming_test.go`\n\nAdd integration tests mirroring Codex's Task 2.5 — success path and fallback-on-unrecognized-flag.\n\n### Task 5.7: Smoke test against real Copilot CLI\n\n- [ ] **Step 1:** Build if needed: `go build -o entire ./cmd/entire`\n\n- [ ] **Step 2:**\n\n```fish\n./entire configure --summarize-provider copilot-cli\n./entire checkpoint explain --checkpoint <SMOKE_CHECKPOINT_ID> --generate --force\n```\n\nExpected: phase events render with `deltaContent` accumulating during PhaseGenerating; final result is the assembled assistant response.\n\n- [ ] **Step 3:** Timeout diagnostic: `--summary-timeout-seconds 3` variant.\n\n### Task 5.8: Verify and commit chunk 5\n\n- [ ] **Step 1:** `mise run check`. Expected: green.\n\n- [ ] **Step 2:**\n\n```bash\ngit add cmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/\ngit commit -m \"feat(copilotcli): implement StreamingTextGenerator\n\nCopilot now emits live progress events through the explain --generate UI.\nparseCopilotStream consumes \\`copilot --output-format json --stream on\n--allow-all-tools --disable-builtin-mcps\\` NDJSON output and dispatches\nour 4 phases. Session-loading events (mcp_servers_loaded, skills_loaded,\ntools_updated) are ignored. Falls back to non-streaming GenerateText if\nthe CLI rejects the streaming flags.\n\nVerified end-to-end against the real copilot CLI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\"\n```\n\n---","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1090,"oldLines":33,"newStart":1090,"newLines":33,"lines":[" "," ## Chunk 3: Gemini streaming"," ","-**Outcome:** Same as Chunk 2 but for `gemini-cli`. One commit.","+**Outcome:** `entire explain --generate` with provider `gemini-cli` shows live progress. The `*GeminiCLIAgent` implements `StreamingTextGenerator`. Manually verified end-to-end against the real `gemini` CLI. One commit."," "," ### Task 3.1: Capture real Gemini stream format"," ","-- [ ] **Step 1:** Capture:","+- [ ] **Step 1:** Capture (use a tiny prompt to keep cost minimal):"," "," ```fish","-echo \"say hi in 5 words\" | gemini --output-format stream-json -p \" \" > /tmp/gemini-real.jsonl 2>&1","+echo \"say hi in 5 words\" | gemini --output-format stream-json -p \" \" --model gemini-3-flash-preview > /tmp/gemini-real.jsonl 2>&1"," cat /tmp/gemini-real.jsonl"," ```"," ","-- [ ] **Step 2:** Observed shape (per pre-plan investigation):","-  - `{\"type\":\"init\",\"timestamp\":\"...\",\"session_id\":\"...\",\"model\":\"...\"}`","-  - `{\"type\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"...\",\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"...\"}` (echo of input)","-  - `{\"type\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"...\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"...\",\"delta\":true}` (chunked)","+- [ ] **Step 2:** Expected event shape (per pre-plan investigation):","+  - `{\"type\":\"init\",\"timestamp\":\"...\",\"session_id\":\"...\",\"model\":\"...\"}` — once at start","+  - `{\"type\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"...\",\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"...\"}` — echo of the prompt (ignored)","+  - `{\"type\":\"message\",\"timesta